WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
One spine, three prototypes and twelve year-round uses.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Three key areas unfold into fifteen linked spatial rooms.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
One asset kit moves from event to everyday and then care.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Eight component families are removable, repairable and storable.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Six user groups keep staffed, no-phone and exit routes.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Six human delivery gates decide whether an asset can advance.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Until six evidence locks clear, spatial expression cannot become a site claim.
